OL,3,GNEWSACourt case against ex-head over
OL,4,Apupil kiss discontinued
OL,5,
OL,6,FCourt proceedings against a former head
OL,7,Fteacher over alleged sexual activity
OL,8,Fwith a pupil have been discontinued.
OL,10,FJames Rouse, 49, of Lowford Hill Close
OL,11,Fin Bursledon, Hampshire, was accused of
OL,12,Fkissing the girl before October 2006
OL,13,Fwhile he was a physics teacher.
OL,15,FThe case was part of a wider police
OL,16,Finvestigation into allegations of
OL,17,Fhistorical sexual abuse at St Anne's
OL,18,FCatholic School and Sixth Form College
OL,19,Fin Southampton, where Mr Rouse was
OL,20,Fheadteacher from 2017.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
