OL,3,GNEWSACourt case against ex-head over
OL,4,Apupil kiss discontinued
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial in November 2025 at Portsmouth
OL,7,FCrown Court resulted in a hung jury. A
OL,8,Fretrial was scheduled to start on
OL,9,FMonday but at a hearing at the same
OL,10,Fcourt earlier no further evidence on
OL,11,Fthe case was offered.
